<title>USA: Inter-Continental names Meyer president.</title>
<headline>Inter-Continental names Meyer president.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, Mo. 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Inter-Continental Services Corp, which provides credit services for commercial clients, said Tuesday Robert Meyer was appointed as new president of the company.</p>
<p>He succeeds James Bell, who resigned as chairman of the board, president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Meyer is president and chief executive officer of Access Medical Systems Inc, a medical software company, that has tentatively agreed to merge with Inter-Continental.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
